{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1441,
  "batch_count": 1645,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:547c488a772db0e50b805f7e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "高举军旗吧！\r\n胜利机会就在单片羽翼的前方！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b0e9eca30d5d32240cb4753b7cde3bdcf4f43fe750f6db0e8c2fab2e54042a41",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "20027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d72c06fa58db3a3f7d1d4c12",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你听得到吗？\r\n我灵魂轻快又雀跃的声音！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a0ff1b4d81334ea652b0ead3574ff08f395f092264597882a2450edc60b9fc3c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "20028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bc51fe071f917f4f21584f50",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "该完成的事情没有改变──\r\n秩序掌握在吾手中！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cd350572f2d8aeafc289b74f084e5d6f075329e55f5f311baddaedbce36b660d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "20029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4fe20a759c51a534288cdbec",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "吾仅需驰骋在荒野中──\r\n而你仅需为吾的表现心动！",
      "source_fingerprint": "143ba9cb10a3f720dcd56ce1acc23160264a7d7891d571db13c0e51c18d60a48",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "20030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:000b0f856aa8113d81af8d9e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "考验、祈祷不会改变……！\r\n我要与万千火焰一同奔跑！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5622a49d392da0122290e9b42c628c2217ccc017e643bc2dab5d737b220b6dca",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "20031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c703c8d73b1ad33ea1b7f049",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……唔，今天左手始终隐隐作痛着，\r\n但……！呵呵！带有让步的比赛，\r\n对我来说刚刚好！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9857230472ea700106b6d7682463cf7ffb2be95a43b5459139e8f799a205f0cd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "20032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8cbdf122e7880d735f15fc6b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "「调整不足」啊──哼！\r\n别担心！这只是枝微末节的小事！\r\n我的炼狱火焰不会就这样熄灭！",
      "source_fingerprint": "38c5101ae8388b6903605bde3f827ffa4801417889f71c469930065d4d7a1503",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "20033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:92b2598dbb84750fb4fc7b51",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有意思……第十三关考验啊──！\r\n我会将这一切化为我的功绩！",
      "source_fingerprint": "61df9314f33bda77a43a932e19c5ba2bbe9bd93aea78ddc6b8649fe39342a3e6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "20034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:172cd74dab9a13e6320bf5a8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "巴别塔──终将迎接崩毁的命运吗。\r\n不……！我不承认……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cf14ef30314561acde38a13ffc83408299f0e1c6ed02dacbfda6029fbb1e63fd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "20035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:67c94fab480704af8b6c572a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……唔……\r\n听到了身体发出叹息声──",
      "source_fingerprint": "49b53c660be2e2cbdf93a7dc7207fcab75ea3f8cdadf0f31d2f6e3a176701752",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "20036"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4ffd678dcd7c008a254ee9ea",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……呼──！\r\n……集中力在……可恶！",
      "source_fingerprint": "82ed68d22d50086ce1bbb0f1ff6902dd1cf37bb2398d8fe065bfe6973c090455",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "20037"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:820ff15db5cc7b7b91fc7315",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "开始吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5340d32cafefeb07fb71f273be0d9e41c17a0c3f97ce3ec0784aa70ad39fd299",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "20038"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f3140b08545d3a073b2347a3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "交给我吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "abd39c284289b19c8944436e7ca3b6b2ead589d70912da6f1ecd3665819f7367",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "20039"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:597687923e78d5b38e4a6c42",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这是考验！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ef512db6558976641413f1f22428247b14cd3a8ee61d28d6ef73ad0b447dc461",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "20040"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:33de6a2b7a2b0966ea585e20",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "如果是芦苇。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5cd308b9383d9f187064c7b12ff8b522f095eef9ff69ada0654c3a853692829a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "20041"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:103af4a8095904c2bdca318b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔……",
      "source_fingerprint": "57a4e1df408b325e7498dd0dbd16dfa65e96cd654a4bab6bba7b78f0a47f36a6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "20042"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:89028b6bc024a6425e8b8d45",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "太遗憾了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "2d8a565badea463d7e46dd935fa389e0610161e938859c3aee45106a758a5e58",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "20043"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:860be973f664c53be2d13986",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "新的旅程啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4f03b62c4b3101c592b0b52a460032a6de49a86f3213f8ec67d6446fd16de945",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "20046"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9e9d27144e64cff342758e2f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "回到母亲般的大海怀抱！",
      "source_fingerprint": "51072b3bb6e6f30a8d0ab3903e361c74fa2e66000aa642b92249c3147b842e84",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "20047"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9764d58555d79fa9a0fe87b3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "极品美酒完成了──\r\n容我向你致谢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "38f9d55addc7f52e6b4e3e5d4472f2daaff889bc25c05273f507d6f6cacf95d1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "20049"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2cf971a5672a3af76c7fab63",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你的罗盘从不失准。",
      "source_fingerprint": "eb3e98ebb0a1e56354f0d5f046635c943337a7f4963ce80081ed8f6c715a3929",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "20050"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a966f8191405c1aa619beafb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "展现你的力量吧──！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cfda2dd3e24b38a0058782cc2ce72f056571a306dbe1bb08b96092fcf353c0dc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "20051"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3b31fdfe5012ac734b78ae1c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "战士啊，集合吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6c3f13542f7a1cd20894fedea598b718dd0b3ffb4ddc88e33141061125067ca9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "2030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b0956d1da3d739faf0de8852",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "来，咆哮吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0b8aba0cfb21888f6f3a869c308619ba765b454152f3e74236c9a7d2dca26ebb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "2031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4be9f9f4d1fe42ca5926c658",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你的罗盘从不失准。",
      "source_fingerprint": "eb3e98ebb0a1e56354f0d5f046635c943337a7f4963ce80081ed8f6c715a3929",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "2032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b4ab0122825e5fddb90de8b1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你听得到吗？\r\n我灵魂兴奋的声音！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0758274137edd393b0515fa168e11f02c3b2733e6be997b7e7784498f5163db5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "2033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cf1a06e084ba02425f353434",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵呵呵……！哈──哈哈哈！\r\n烙印在大脑、视网膜、记忆中吧！\r\n这就是吾的存在意义！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4ec5a67e8871495b5b269665d1d813548a483f1cfe518d4372f95e72b5df050b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "2034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cf6d4a3ea276f84c5178a857",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你的罗盘从不失准。",
      "source_fingerprint": "eb3e98ebb0a1e56354f0d5f046635c943337a7f4963ce80081ed8f6c715a3929",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "2035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e796c303fa80ecca84c0da99",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "始めよう。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0a91c3a42bee3b610a977d9d276cc865eacf6a6007436b210196e4495453836d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "23015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a62458f5cbf7b243224f63ac",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "别担心，可能性还没消失！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0118ed55deb4c790e006ebe5cad8d96ecca1fd7ce431ecc4d269d4efc1c4b4a3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "30000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9ac09d3d0a492fa3c920e788",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "乐园路迢迢啊……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b6990e80a52e5a61868f79f081218d7a758b519afed8d92b300fc3068b752737",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "30001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e26912d88ad1bdc42557bd16",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哼……有很多该跨越的考验……",
      "source_fingerprint": "ac347601a482b88e672742af514aeaa6b35ba373dad4fa5bcade02d1d595fbb7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "30002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d15a1ea3ab19b0a6d247c9a0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "迷失在迷宫里了啊……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a1febd3c081c72ac27599d20462e3b8196d1656bb6f53ca9fc02e31d6fce79c1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "30003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:956a64bebbfc4615c8753fd8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为吾沉醉吧！为我这胜利美酒沉醉！",
      "source_fingerprint": "26d552eb6b578e154788aaae9d70232beb2e91ef0805e84345002c387b041146",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "30004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:269810fc250cd6e3a565c2fc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵！全新的创世纪诞生了呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8cdb166320b59a2168ddbe51d878133e3de4238354d2cbaf944c6b1499c4717f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "30005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0c2b3d84459cace72871a2e6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "来，深深刻划吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a88b122f5f15b6a1bc77b7b8cdf0e520cc7e6e488cf705ab2090c06b1043c817",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "31000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2e2d46674a3b41b200918e06",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "带来破坏与酩酊吧！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2a87c785477eae4abbd68a5aa317f1fde2e0e17e65ea8e62d9569393f4f75727",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "40000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5326907e723c1c25aa0b935d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "演劇…それは刹那の断片。\r\n演じることもまた、刹那の仮初だ。\r\n…ワタシが創るに相応しい！",
      "source_fingerprint": "03ecc58179cc76a625d48e8dfa94a2a147bb4d81784e1f5b950d2dd924b42e3d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "400001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:579eff98082c199d70722e57",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "そう…そうだ、それでいい！\r\n劇よ走れ、我が為の結末に\r\n向かって…突き進むのだ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d9a2f278d916a893bc065e41224c1dd2d43e2799699ae184d4ef6bf8885bf52f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "400008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9750650ee1a329612e1eaec0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "さて…業火よ、焼き尽くすがいい。\r\n台本は不要だ。別れを継ぎ接ぎ、\r\n次なる役を演じるために…さらば！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cdb413f9470bbae71ef30e09256ee0f638c4b07dc8f0e137da8fc95a4a1f4fc9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "400009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8432a1153fcb18b8904312bb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "吾手中是潘多拉之盒，禁忌果实──\r\n沉醉于破坏、禁忌，沉醉于吾吧！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "131426521ae4cc02b8ff403ef5b8b14d4f2b1034d21ac0fbe459a56a21f67099",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "40001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b33489fa5fec389cee1b66d3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "吾的天籁──连岩户都会为之敞开。",
      "source_fingerprint": "abd0200ba0001ae63fc919f7e5955f5cc8dedebe2e6b9cd9a7a9e26adc035e52",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "60000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3c1e1b1ec9b8389dea12b38b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "来，举起酒杯！\r\n派对就要揭幕了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0dd71dc0610424f54843495a9971eb802f4f1cead44c7b2c09c666a309ff1997",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "60001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:15190ce50b7353a62b08fb81",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我会让你陷入沉醉──",
      "source_fingerprint": "4b302047c336c5641d836581eafa060d0e5f9ebdedb6767e3db1c6a7dbf90fe3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "70000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d03a65817da0a3dbf9a7f8a8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这是在我的认知中最为极品的酩酊。\r\n没有你就调制不出这杯琴蕾。\r\n你可绝对别忘了这点啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d78cbfdd9f620e85619e5bf7a2de96936e738c79aabe40938a3caa24b3c04cc1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "70001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3fe8d6297c703402bd900577",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然有想过要染成漆黑，\r\n……却遭到了天罚。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9780f3e20211cb867781eff1d7de2e51acb19a0c9dc26728181d1aad9c31713a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "70004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b07bcbc6729e86e2eec40972",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "穿上美丽衣裳的吾──！\r\n这耀眼的光芒简直是罪恶……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8c0f402041f72897e5e260bfab2b88f018f2682c3dc15cc2f0516967b076be30",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "70008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:265713f71a3b887aac16c4d5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵！看到了吗……！\r\n吾真实的模样！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9426db0036d690f48f293ec4501f71948373dde8cc50d2789d6d0a833535e229",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "70009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ab09fc9abab07c7261167cdd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔……右手在隐隐作痛！\r\n得用宝具封印起来……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bf5a45d4e8c5765a830806febb488845129c2cffaa067a939ced0cc299b9017e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "70010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3456ac3799ba2fde6be84681",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "华丽的色彩。\r\n简直就是适合飨宴的服装呢……",
      "source_fingerprint": "cb94dc89165e87a17b0c1c87c349723e837562c4c42c959339d30b574da24a76",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "70014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3928590eae377b77760ad847",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵呵……灵魂蠢蠢欲动！\r\n快让我奔跑吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7b8b910f495189b301eaf348874b974ea044243c24dc755bb540c9fca7b897cf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "70015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3e57b922923cd3535183e09d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "想要全新的人格吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "e29e492c48dde9f5e2a1503d2857d4801704e371530f96426bd2e943f901664c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "70018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:72cdf93b440c1a142573f0ee",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "服装需要的就是──\r\n极为美丽的噩梦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1224fdd6a02646ba07364ba0f9acd1db50c1815038681c9d2f70673704e0a371",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "70019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c4ec3028199779b3d4584359",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然有想过要染成漆黑，\r\n……却遭到了天罚。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9780f3e20211cb867781eff1d7de2e51acb19a0c9dc26728181d1aad9c31713a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "71004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b2da67c720867250ffab2e30",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "穿上美丽衣裳的吾──！\r\n这耀眼的光芒简直是罪恶……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8c0f402041f72897e5e260bfab2b88f018f2682c3dc15cc2f0516967b076be30",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "71008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f67fcc6430f69070df986e43",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵！看到了吗……！\r\n吾真实的模样！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9426db0036d690f48f293ec4501f71948373dde8cc50d2789d6d0a833535e229",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "71009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:83b23c7d987bc30425aac92b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔……右手在隐隐作痛！\r\n得用宝具封印起来……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bf5a45d4e8c5765a830806febb488845129c2cffaa067a939ced0cc299b9017e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "71010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:db793c0e6cb9c7c68726d9ac",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "华丽的色彩。\r\n简直就是适合飨宴的服装呢……",
      "source_fingerprint": "cb94dc89165e87a17b0c1c87c349723e837562c4c42c959339d30b574da24a76",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "71014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b420a79a1510571f67e4905f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵呵……灵魂蠢蠢欲动！\r\n快让我奔跑吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7b8b910f495189b301eaf348874b974ea044243c24dc755bb540c9fca7b897cf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "71015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6aea265d29465dc44f312c2a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "想要全新的人格吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "e29e492c48dde9f5e2a1503d2857d4801704e371530f96426bd2e943f901664c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "71018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1613b98fff4f087276932c98",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "服装需要的就是──\r\n极为美丽的噩梦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1224fdd6a02646ba07364ba0f9acd1db50c1815038681c9d2f70673704e0a371",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "71019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6c408e27837461c5e201af10",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你很厉害嘛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5397b4fef55f6c897e05a67aabf4682cfbac8f67233993186fd02576fd651f82",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "80000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b0aca857eceb37e6256dd8a2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊──哈哈哈！迎接黎明，\r\n新世界揭开序幕了！！踏出步伐，\r\n迈向鲜烈的「此刻」──！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4417a10edc1adbb175ac84034ecc1e1cf49d6e334acd54f39cb47acb4620a33c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "90000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a5c9fb53cbdd4aa143c04f72",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你今天要如何接纳我。\r\n……说来听听。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3a2240d83e073e9e7aad7fb24d1a930bb2277909e89b753a661e6192921ed364",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "90001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fb46bfe32eab6d6a2d83cd90",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊哈哈哈！舒爽的白天！\r\n是最适合彰显破坏的瞬间！\r\n令人愉快的时刻──要开始啦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c3c771e599119bfcc2d7991764fa5fddb0b89d6027b625e6c085241145df8d48",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "90002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e33498d44333340edc562d6b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "身上背负的七宗罪。\r\n该精进的自由七艺。\r\n……好了，该从哪里开始享受？",
      "source_fingerprint": "ce45ce5b04ae26429a0143a6c19b844d90cc8518004e32eb8cc09f0c9b96356c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "90003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d743fbb7266b5c7791e18506",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "狼在今日是否就将追赶上月亮，\r\n进而引发诸神黄昏呢……\r\n呵呵，让我好好见证吧……",
      "source_fingerprint": "f70c72d91e50a586b101c85164eceb4e3b039587deef352d7842cfdad0e30b30",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "90004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:54b2cabf033bae772e00526b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "休息五分钟够吗？总是汲汲营营\r\n会显得生活毫无雅致。若你希冀，\r\n就让我调上一杯供你小憩吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "98e4d2271e9cd82e859df646b0f43f271ce38df72a936755fa1cb57e32d80d01",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "90005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:01c1285e4e7ba81a10df9520",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "新出现的迷惘羔羊群，一看到吾便\r\n落荒而逃……呵，这就是足以毁天\r\n灭地的异能者的感受吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7a9dbf159ad8266ad853b74213f887325c038641b884d6426b812bbc9fbe50fc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "90006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:383cbe6be16f809d2a94fabd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为了抵御暑气，我准备了灵药。\r\n不但口感清凉，用以补充矿物质\r\n也相当合适……你要不要来一点？",
      "source_fingerprint": "0db22b1371b67b51db04f2be5f5f8210f5a2dab703a9fdcf3f43df1733cffa4b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "90007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f15ae587a5cad3bd48d4613c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我们赛马娘在大地奔跑，因此看见\r\n落叶、落果、落穗后……便会觉得\r\n今年也得感谢大地的恩惠才行呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6ca5670d53e069afe1a1d176205012d1f3b1d815bbb2a3fe2104d45398aca463",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "90008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b9702807a27357891a0b4589",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "被点缀上深红色的极辣「拉」面……\r\n……呵呵，不愧是殿下的推荐。\r\n一股暖流直窜身体深处，毫不留情。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ebb7a4a62b72fef00aa23cd753060d525b38568524df055d156a9fc9a6d314d1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "90009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:57ba428e88791736b77be0fc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好好感谢圣人的慈爱吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f3c07e3e6650532a41ed95218310b157065bde72fe4017d0f8f9eaa745795ee4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "90020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8fe33e03e169b431ff2b365d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……伏特加。与我追寻着相同\r\n美学之人。如果是她，\r\n吾所说的剎那或许能……",
      "source_fingerprint": "1db0a7c9b7c8b89daf1209a29110da211b9a9c07131401ab38df174a1b25ffdb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "91000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e628fe8170ec05246c836c67",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "如果吉兆自称军神，\r\n吾就该演出光之神啊。\r\n呵呵……就让吾来完美诠释吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "60ec365de5c9f50898999057e0fd1bbda1714b624a0bd558c4e75a56c975c72f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "91001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ac610c5317c7d6dde104cc00",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "如同生与死是一体两面，\r\n破坏也必定伴随着重生。\r\n这就是我的规则……我的美学。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e1dc36ae5fdc7849ad33894e2b1e244de9f4d2733729df22bd1143daf8b8af2e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "91002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0011347425359fabb774637e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "所谓神话，就是集结了过去的\r\n一连串剎那后化为永恒的产物。\r\n因此值得尊敬，且有着流传的价值。",
      "source_fingerprint": "048241910492048f1cdce40fd1376ce027e075ad0949a3cafdd4ad2be31aba04",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "91003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cf574cbf3eb065eb0f13fda5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这个雪克杯是父亲送的礼物……\r\n吾认为这代表着调制出琴蕾，\r\n是吾总有一天必须达成的使命。",
      "source_fingerprint": "08ae03c3538af91fee5285d9ea1cf3435694a4a17378b4abcc69925cf892b2a8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "91004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:14f06ef8120d8eae90b36b35",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "舞台是葡萄酒神的统领之地──\r\n既然如此，吾会发光发热\r\n也是理所当然的！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b9bc9ec19aa8fa10a8383f445920d95269ecea1419a79c0a92c6ae74200bc422",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "91005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fc62c67eacf006abe61ef4ad",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虚构与真实。二律背反。\r\n而正是因为相反，人们才会对舞台\r\n酩酊并为其狂热……我说得没错吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "32d8d9b9f274df895147369cfcae805c8eaeecbcc89cd13d8ec5a19f94d54ade",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1084",
        "91006"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
